e states of the report approval process.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Pending\",\"Approved\",\"Rejected\"]},{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Feedback Type\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Feedback Type: Positive, Negative, Neutral' specifies the categories of feedback that can be received from stakeholders.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Positive\",\"Negative\",\"Neutral\"]},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Revision Count\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Revision Count: integer between 0 and 10' represents the number of times the report has been revised.\",\"min_value\":0,\"max_value\":10,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"binds\":[{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Collect Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Collect Data' activity represents the process of gathering raw data from various sources for analysis.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Data Points\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Data Points: integer between 100 and 10000' represents the number of data points collected during the data collection phase.\",\"min_value\":100,\"max_value\":10000,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Collect Data: Data Points' specifies that the activity 'Collect Data' requires the attribute 'Data Points'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves examining and processing the collected data to derive meaningful insights.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Report Accuracy\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Report Accuracy: float between 0.0 and 100.0' represents the accuracy percentage of the analyzed data in the report.\",\"min_value\":0.0,\"max_value\":100.0,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Analyze Data: Report Accuracy' links the 'Analyze Data' activity with the attribute 'Report Accuracy'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Approve Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Report' activity involves giving formal approval for the report to proceed to publication.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Approval Status\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Approval Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected' specifies the possible states of the report approval process.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Pending\",\"Approved\",\"Rejected\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Approve Report: Approval Status' links the 'Approve Report' activity with the attribute 'Approval Status'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Gather Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Feedback' activity involves collecting opinions and comments from stakeholders about the published report.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Feedback Type\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Feedback Type: Positive, Negative, Neutral' specifies the categories of feedback that can be received from stakeholders.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Positive\",\"Negative\",\"Neutral\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Gather Feedback: Feedback Type' links the 'Gather Feedback' activity with the attribute 'Feedback Type'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Revise Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Revise Report' activity involves making corrections or improvements to the report based on received feedback.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Revision Count\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Revision Count: integer between 0 and 10' represents the number of times the report has been revised.\",\"min_value\":0,\"max_value\":10,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Revise Report: Revision Count' links the 'Revise Report' activity with the attribute 'Revision Count'.\"}],\"constraints\":[{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Collect Data' must be the first activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"Init\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Collect Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Collect Data' activity re