port' activity involves giving formal approval for the report to proceed to publication.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Publish Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Publish Report' activity involves making the approved report available to the intended audience.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Approval Status is Approved\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,2,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Gather Feedback' activity occurs with 'Feedback Type' set to 'Negative', then a 'Revise Report' activity must eventually occur after the 'Gather Feedback' event at some point within 0 to 5 days in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Gather Feedback' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Revise Report' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Gather Feedback'. If 'Gather Feedback' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Revise Report'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Gather Feedback\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Feedback' activity involves collecting opinions and comments from stakeholders about the published report.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Revise Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Revise Report' activity involves making corrections or improvements to the report based on received feedback.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Feedback Type is Negative\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,5,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Revise Report' activity and another 'Revise Report' activity must not occur such that a 'Revise Report' event is followed by another 'Revise Report' event at any point later in the same process instance when the 'Revision Count' is greater than 3. Similarly, a 'Revise Report' event must not be preceded by another 'Revise Report' event. This means that once a 'Revise Report' occurs with 'Revision Count' greater than 3, another 'Revise Report' cannot occur afterward, and if a 'Revise Report' event occurs, it cannot have been preceded by another 'Revise Report' event. Both events can occur in the same process instance, but not in the prohibited sequence.\",\"template\":\"Not Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Revise Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Revise Report' activity involves making corrections or improvements to the report based on received feedback.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Revise Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Revise Report' activity involves making corrections or improvements to the report based on received feedback.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Revision Count > 3\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity is permitted to occur only if an 'Approve Report' activity with 'Report Accuracy' greater than or equal to 90 has occurred before it within the same process instance.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves examining and processing the collected data to derive meaningful insights.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Approve Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Report' activity involves giving formal approval for the report to proceed to publication.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Report Accuracy >= 90\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Each occurrence of an 'Analyze Data' activity must eventually be followed by a 'Draft Report' activity within 0 to 48 hours, and each occurrence of a 'Draft Report' must be preceded by 'Analyze Data', with no intermediate occurrences of 'Analyze Data' or 'Draft Report' between them.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves examining and processing the collected data to derive meaningful insights.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Draft Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Draft Report' activity involves creating an initial version of the report based on the analyzed data.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,48,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever an 'Approve Report' activity occurs with 'Approval Status' set to 'Approved', it must be immediately followed by a 'Publish Report' activity in the next event position within 0 to 3 days, with no other events in between. The 'Publish Report' activity is allowed to happen isolated.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Approve Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Report' activity involves giving formal approval for the report to proceed to publication.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Publish Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Publish Report' activity involves making the approved report available to the intended audience.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Approval Status is Approved\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,3,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever a 'Draft Report' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Review Report' activity within 0 to 1 hour, with no other events in between. Conversely, whenever a 'Review Report' event occurs, it must be immediately preceded by a 'Draft Report' event, with no other events in between.\",\"template\":\"Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Draft Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Draft Report' activity involves creating an initial version of the report based on the analyzed data.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Review Report\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Report' activity includes examining the drafted report for accuracy, completeness, and quality.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,1,h\",\"cardinality\":null}]}"